# 统一换行符：仓库里一律 LF，Windows 批处理保留 CRLF。
# 不设这个文件的话，Windows 上 clone 出来是 CRLF，跨行正则断言会假失败。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.nsh text eol=crlf
*.vbs text eol=crlf

*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.node binary
*.zip binary
